"For at anmode om én, brug <a href=\"%(url)s\">Kontakt</a>-linket i "
"navigationsmenuen ovenfor."

#: .\templates\pages\home.html:17
msgid ""
"SLIC is free to use for non-commercial research. If you use SLIC to collect "
"data, please cite: Montgomery, Walker &amp; Woods (2025), <em>Linguistics "
"Vanguard</em> 11(1): 397-406. <a href='https://doi.org/10.1515/"
"lingvan-2025-0028' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>doi:10.1515/"
"lingvan-2025-0028</a>"
msgstr ""
"SLIC er gratis at bruge til ikke-kommerciel forskning. Hvis du bruger SLIC "
"til dataindsamling, bedes du citere: Montgomery, Walker &amp; Woods (2025), "
"<em>Linguistics Vanguard</em> 11(1): 397-406. <a href='https://doi."
"org/10.1515/lingvan-2025-0028' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>doi:10.1515/"
